    "Runs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跑步次数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跑步次數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs count entirely in the period they start in, on their recorded local date. “Last N months” always starts on a whole period. Ascent uses corrected elevation when available, otherwise the raw source ascent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次跑步按其记录的当地日期，完整计入开始时所在的周期。“最近 N 个月”始终从完整的周期开始。爬升在有校正海拔时使用校正海拔，否则使用来源的原始爬升。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次跑步依其記錄的當地日期，完整計入開始時所在的週期。「最近 N 個月」一律從完整的週期開始。爬升在有校正海拔時使用校正海拔，否則使用來源的原始爬升。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on this Route" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此路线上的跑步"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此路線上的跑步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs without usable heart rate get a clearly-labelled estimated load from pace and duration. Estimates are informative per run but stay out of the fitness/fatigue/form model by default — inventing inputs would bias the curve downward, which understates fatigue. You can opt in on the Trends chart if you mostly run without a strap." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有可用心率的跑步会根据配速和时长得出明确标注的估算负荷。估算值对单次跑步有参考价值，但默认不计入体能/疲劳/状态模型 — 虚构输入会使曲线偏低，从而低估疲劳。如果你大多不戴心率带跑步，可以在趋势图表中选择纳入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有可用心率的跑步會依配速和時長得出明確標示的估算負荷。估算值對單次跑步有參考價值，但預設不納入體能/疲勞/狀態模型 — 虛構輸入會使曲線偏低，進而低估疲勞。如果你大多不戴心率帶跑步，可以在趨勢圖表中選擇納入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
