    "The folder is remembered as a bookmark beside your workout library on this Mac. Tiles never leave it, and nothing is uploaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此文件夹以书签形式保存在这台 Mac 上的运动资料库旁边。瓦片绝不会离开这台 Mac，也不会上传任何内容。"
