    "The tile folder “%@” could not be opened. If it moved, choose it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法打开瓦片文件夹“%@”。如果它已被移动，请重新选取。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法打開圖磚檔案夾「%@」。如果它已被移動，請重新選取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two published Banister coefficient sets come from male and female cohorts. The choice scales the magnitude of your loads more than their shape, so fitness, fatigue, and form trends are largely unaffected by picking the 'wrong' one. Leave the default if unsure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两组已发表的 Banister 系数分别来自男性和女性群体。这一选择主要影响负荷的大小而非其形态，因此即使选“错”，体能、疲劳和状态趋势也基本不受影响。如不确定，请保留默认设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兩組已發表的 Banister 係數分別來自男性與女性群體。這項選擇主要影響負荷的大小而非其形態，因此即使選「錯」，體能、疲勞與狀態趨勢也大致不受影響。如果不確定，請保留預設設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
